WEBVTT

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:04.440
<i>Kili Surtr Muspelheim...</i>

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.880
<i>Burns things and people without 
so much as touching them.</i>

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A D excelling in fire.</i>

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:14.860
<i>She chose to live as a Dragon.</i>

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.750
<i>Emergency alert! Emergency alert!</i>

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.610
Alert level A, Type Blue.

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.570
I repeat. Alert level A, Type Blue.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.240
Blue Hecatoncheir.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:42.390
Nii-san...

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.070
Why is it here?

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.740
That's... a Dragon...

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:18.140
<b><i>Unlimited Fafnir</i></b>

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:30.620
<b>Red-Winged Tiamat</b>

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.610
Defense systems functioning normally.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.790
Then what's going on?

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.200
Are you telling me no one noticed it?

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.560
We can't help that it showed up.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.440
But did it have to be such a troublesome one?

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:56.380
Non-combatants, calmly make 
your way to the shelters.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:59.460
Please do not approach the 
academy under any circumstances.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.950
She's the only one whose Ryumon 
is confirmed to have changed.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:11.670
Which means that the Hecatoncheir 
may be after Tear Lightning.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.810
Understood, Shinomiya-sensei.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.960
Just what's going on?

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.590
How could Midgar's defense 
system not have detected it?

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.010
How did it get this close?

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:29.150
Well, all we know is that it's 
right there in front of us.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.410
Nothing more.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.730
Yuu...

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:37.360
Don't make that scary face.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.550
You'll worry Tear-san.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.780
Lisa...

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:46.790
This is your first time seeing 
a real Dragon, isn't it?

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.140
But don't worry.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.960
We're here with you.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:54.720
Okay.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.420
Sorry, Tear.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.380
No, it's okay.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.340
Lisa-san, I'd like you to be 
in charge of Tear-san's safety.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.800
Not Mononobe Yuu?

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.560
Nii-san has another job to do.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:14.000
So I'd like you to do it instead.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.290
Tear-san trusts you,

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:22.280
and you're the one who can respond 
most flexibly when you must.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.650
I understand.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.950
Are you leaving, Yuu?

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:32.880
Don't worry. I won't vanish or anything.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:34.870
I'll be back, I promise.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.050
But...

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.590
He'll be fine.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.180
He clearly seems quite tough.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:45.800
Fine.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:52.070
Fyril-san, Ren-san, please stand 
by on the school rooftop.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.020
<i>Understood.</i>

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.170
<i>Mitsuki-chan, what about me?</i>

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.720
Iris-san, join up with us.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:03.410
Ariela-san, report from the sky 
on any changes in the situation.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.400
<i>Got it.</i>

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.870
Okay, I'm wearing it.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.630
Don't just watch! Get to the shelter, quick!

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:17.290
O-Okay.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.810
It's not moving.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.700
I wonder what's wrong.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:40.820
It's no use thinking about a Dragon's behavior.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:45.880
It's not even understood why 
they're roaming the world.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.350
Listen.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.990
There's no point in trying to defeat it.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.230
A Hecatoncheir doesn't die.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.750
Even if you injure it, it returns to normal.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.320
Even if we all attack at the same time?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:01.460
There's a record of NIFL successfully vaporizing

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.560
the entire body using fuel-air explosives,

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.930
but it regenerated completely.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.640
<i>All we can do is defend ourselves 
to the best of our abilities</i>

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.270
<i>to minimize casualties.</i>

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.390
<i>There are exceptions.</i>

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.740
I want strength.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:22.760
I accept your offer.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.940
Connection: accepted.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:33.530
Fire!

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:44.500
You brought me here because 
you plan on fighting it off

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.800
like I did three years ago, didn't you?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:47.600
Yes.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:52.720
You're the only one who could drive it off,

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.510
even if only temporarily.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.550
But...

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.320
That's a last resort.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.240
If we do the same thing we did last time,

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.370
Midgar will also suffer vast damage.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.910
And...

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:22.560
Would you be okay using that power?

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:25.600
Yeah, I'll be fine.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.340
Besides, what's the point if I don't use it now?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:30.880
I have to protect Tear and the academy.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.640
I need to focus on that.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.720
Understood.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.850
You must be scared.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.610
Don't worry. I'm here with you.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.480
I won't let the Dragon have you.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.420
I won't leave you alone.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.800
Can Yuu and the others win?

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:03.120
Trusting her man and waiting for 
him is a woman's fortitude.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.540
A woman's fortitude?

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:08.250
It's part of being a good wife.

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:11.510
Okay.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:33.450
Who's there?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.570
I've come for you, Tear.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:45.070
Kili...

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:46.340
Kili?

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.000
Would you hand her over, please?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.460
What are you saying?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.650
Now, come.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.270
Gungnir!

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.700
Run, Tear-san.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.030
Lisa!

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.100
Hurry!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.830
What's this nonsense?

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.960
I can't let you have Tear-san.

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.690
Oh, dear. Whatever will I do?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.550
This isn't an empty threat.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.730
<i>What was that?</i>

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:30.850
I'm not done here yet.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.320
Lisa, this way!

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:54.670
This way.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:14.760
Lisa!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.340
I'm fine.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.940
It's just a scrape.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.900
But...

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.870
You can't be reasoned with, can you, girl?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.900
I would thank you graciously

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.360
if you'd just hand over Tear without resisting.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.050
Gungnir!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.450
I graciously decline.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.410
No, Lisa! Run!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.560
Tear-san,

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.120
holding down the fort while her husband is out

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.590
is part of a woman's fortitude.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.430
I don't have time.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.180
Pierce!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.330
Flare!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.230
Tear-san!

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:55.170
Nii-san?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.920
Did you just hear something?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.650
I didn't.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:01.520
No.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:09.290
The Dragon cultists are starting an 
operation to rescue Tear Lightning.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:09.810
Huh?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:13.160
Midgar's defenses are tough.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.480
It won't be easy for them to infiltrate.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:19.690
Which means <i>she</i> is sure to make a move.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:22.220
No way...

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.280
Nii-san!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.360
Mononobe!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.820
Lisa! Lisa!

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.790
Oh, dear. Whatever is the matter?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:37.460
Weren't you going to show me

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.170
a woman's fortitude?

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:45.840
Lisa!

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:50.760
Lisa! Lisa! Lisa!

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.560
Maybe it was too soon.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.940
Let's go.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.700
I won't let you.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.280
Lisa!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.610
I promised...

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:21.000
I wouldn't... leave you alone.

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.960
You're getting on my nerves.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.300
Mitsuki-chan!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.360
Yes.

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.200
Nii-san!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.280
Don't move!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.110
Let go of Tear,

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.510
Kili Surtr Muspelheim.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:17.590
It looks like I don't need to introduce myself.

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:21.480
I know you very well, too,

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.540
Mononobe Yuu.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:27.530
The only male D in the world.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:30.890
The leader of the Dragon Cultists.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.490
The calamity-class D.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.260
Now, don't look so scary.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:39.590
I want us to be friends.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:49.880
How cruel of you, to shoot me without warning.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:15:59.770
<i>Flames?</i>

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.650
<i>No, that was high-temperature matter conversion.</i>

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.350
<i>When did she...</i>

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:08.550
I just want to take her to the Basilisk,

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:12.530
to where she belongs.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.750
Why must you interfere?

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:18.700
You, and that girl.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:21.200
What have you done to Lisa?

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.920
No...

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.060
It's your fault.

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:34.330
You wouldn't come peacefully.

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.840
That girl...

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.270
My... fault...

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:44.370
And he's going to become a victim, too.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.990
But there's no reason to grieve.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:49.230
None of them are real.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.530
Stop!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.950
Kili, don't do any more!

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:56.450
<i>If live ammo won't work, 
I'll use imaginary weapons.</i>

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.380
Are you going to kill me?

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.410
I'll stop if you kill me.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:01.620
Kili!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.540
Nitro Bullet!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.560
<i>If there was a matter conversion,</i>

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.050
<i>I should have been able to see the dark matter.</i>

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:45.080
Stop.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:59.470
I'll become the Dragon's bride.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.680
There. Well done.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.110
Now, get rid of all the fakes.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:09.150
Become your true self.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.810
What are you?

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.410
I'm...

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.150
a Dragon.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.070
Stop it.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:19.200
Too bad for you.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.430
Tear has already made her choice.

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:25.160
Right?

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:29.370
I promised you I wouldn't vanish, didn't I?

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.840
We're not fake.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:37.050
We're all here, Tear.

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:40.660
Women don't like men who can't give up.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.940
Let's go, now.

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:47.890
For you to become the Basilisk's wife

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:51.700
is the happiest choice for 
everyone, including you.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.400
Happy?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.370
Tear!

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.820
Don't worry. I'm here with you.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.550
I won't let the Dragon have you.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.180
I won't leave you alone.

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.310
No...

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.260
I don't want to go.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:39.610
I'm already happy.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:41.970
I won't go.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.230
I'm staying here.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:49.530
Besides, I'm going to become Yuu's bride!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.600
I'm...

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:56.200
I'm a human girl!

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.610
Nonsense.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:09.810
Then I'll make sure you can't 
live as a human anymore.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:12.060
Stop!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.400
Stop!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.080
Tear!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:38.430
That was a Leviathan's...

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.500
Hand her over.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.850
You can't win against the Basilisk.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.970
I refuse.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.270
We're going to defend Tear.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.750
Do you think you can?

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.840
Everything returns to dust.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:04.160
No one can survive.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.990
And you're going to regret

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:11.020
that you didn't hand Tear over to us today.

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:12.820
"Us"?

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:27.090
I had the Hecatoncheir wait.

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.800
But it looks like it's grown tired of waiting.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.630
Prepare yourself.

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:35.030
The Hecatoncheir isn't as nice as I am.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.240
Mitsuki-chan!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:00.670
So what'll it be?

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.670
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:42.060
I finally get it.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:43.940
I'm not a Dragon.

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:45.440
I'm a human girl.

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:51.650
I want to live like Yuu, Lisa, 
Mitsuki, Iris, and all the others.

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:53.670
So I'm going to fight beside them.

00:23:53.670 --> 00:23:57.870
If I can't defeat the Blue Hecatoncheir, 
I'll blow it away.

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.770
Go!

00:23:59.770 --> 00:24:02.690
Next time on <i>Unlimited Fafnir</i>:

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:04.540
"Scarlet Innocent."

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:09.670
Yuu, once we beat that Dragon, let's get married.

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:19.890
<b>Illustration: Senmu</b>
